mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .75pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in'>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>5. Input and Output Screen Layout<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

</div>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<h3><span style='font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>5.1 Homepage (`<span class=SpellE>index.php</span>`)<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><br>
- <b>Visual Layout:</b> Dark luxury theme (`#0A0A0A` background) with gold
(`#D4AF37`) typography and subtle CSS animations.<br>
- <b>Inputs:</b> Navigation links to Login, Register, Verify Asset, and a
&quot;Connect Wallet&quot; Web3 button.<br>
- <b>Outputs:</b> High-resolution hero banner, value proposition text
(&quot;Immutable Authenticity&quot;), and a promotional showcase of premium
assets.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<h3><span style='font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>5.2 Registration/Login Screen (`<span class=SpellE>login.php</span>`
/ `<span class=SpellE>register.php</span>`)<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><br>
- <b>Visual Layout:</b> Center-aligned, <span class=SpellE>glassmorphism</span>
frosted-glass card overlaying a dark background.<br>
- <b>Inputs (Register):</b> Full Name, Email Address, Password (masked), Role
Dropdown (`Admin`, `Shop`, `User`).<br>
- <b>Validation Rules:</b> Email must be unique and properly formatted;
password must be &gt; 8 characters.<br>
- <b>Outputs:</b> Success redirects to Dashboard. Validation errors (e.g.,
&quot;Invalid credentials&quot;) are displayed in a soft red alert box. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<h3><span style='font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>5.3 Interactive Database Setup (`<span class=SpellE>db_connect.php</span>`
Intercept)<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><br>
- <b>Visual Layout:</b> Presented automatically if the system detects a MySQL
connection failure.<br>
- <b>Inputs:</b> Database Host, Database Name, MySQL Username, MySQL Password.<br>
- <b>Outputs:</b> Automatically writes configuration files, creates databases,
and imports the SQL schema seamlessly.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<h3><span style='font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>5.4 Manufacturer/Shop Dashboard (`<span class=SpellE>dashboard.php</span>`)<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><br>
- <b>Visual Layout:</b> Sidebar navigation with a spacious main content area
utilizing CSS Grid.<br>
- <b>Inputs (Minting Form):</b> <br>
- Token ID (Auto-generated or Manual<span class=GramE>)</span><br>
- Asset Name (Text)<br>
- Category (Dropdown: Ring, Necklace, etc.)<br>
- Weight (Numeric float<span class=GramE>)</span><br>
- Purity (Text: 24k)<br>
- Hallmark (Text)<br>
- Mint Asset Button (Triggers <span class=SpellE>MetaMask</span> popup)<br>
- <b>Outputs:</b> Data table displaying the user's currently owned/minted
inventory, status badges (Stolen/Safe), and recent transaction hashes.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<h3><span style='font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>5.5 Verification Screen (`<span class=SpellE>verify.php</span>`)<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><br>
- <b>Visual Layout:</b> Minimalist, Google-style search interface centered
vertically on the screen.<br>
- <b>Inputs:</b> Large search bar requiring a valid `Token ID`.<br>
- <b>Outputs:</b> <br>
- <b>Success Case:</b> Displays a comprehensive details card featuring the
Asset Name, Original Manufacturer details, Current Owner, and a green &quot;<span
class=SpellE>Blockchain</span> Verified&quot; badge.<br>
- <b>Stolen Case:</b> Displays a highly prominent, flashing red warning alert:
&quot;CAUTION: This asset has been flagged as stolen.&quot;<br>
- <b>Error Case:</b> &quot;Asset not found on the ledger.&quot;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<div class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>

<hr size=2 width="100%" align=center>

</span></div>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<div style='mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .75pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in'>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>6. Testing and Verification Strategy<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

</div>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<h3><span style='font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>6.1 Unit Testing<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><br>
- <b>Smart Contracts:</b> Tested using the Hardhat testing framework and Chai
assertions. Tests verify that only authorized entities can mint, and that
transfers correctly update the mapping balances.<br>
- <b>Backend APIs:</b> <span class=SpellE>PHPUnit</span> tests to verify that
JWT generation, database queries, and data validation behave correctly under
edge cases.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<h3><span style='font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>6.2 End-to-End (E2E) Integration Testing<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><br>
- The complete user journey is tested by simulating a user navigating the
frontend, signing a transaction via a mock Web3 provider, and verifying that
the MySQL database syncs perfectly with the <span class=SpellE>blockchain</span>
state.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<div class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>

<hr size=2 width="100%" align=center>

</span></div>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman";mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;
mso-bidi-language:MR'><br clear=all style='mso-special-character:line-break;
page-break-before:always'>
</span>

<p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='font-size:18.0pt;font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:#2E74B5'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>

<div style='mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .75pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in'>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>7. Future Scope and Enhancements<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

</div>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:12.0pt'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><br>
1. <span class=SpellE><b>IoT</b></span><b> and NFC Integration:</b> Embedding tiny,
tamper-proof NFC chips directly into the <span class=SpellE>jewellery</span>
that, when tapped with a smartphone, instantly opens the `<span class=SpellE>verify.php</span>`
page for that specific Token ID.<br>
2. <b>Layer-2 Deployment:</b> Moving the smart contracts from local Hardhat
testing to a Layer-2 network like Polygon or <span class=SpellE>Arbitrum</span>
to drastically reduce gas fees while maintaining <span class=SpellE>Ethereum</span>-level
security.<br>
3. <b>Decentralized Storage:</b> Integrating IPFS (<span class=SpellE>InterPlanetary</span>
File System) to store high-resolution 3D renders and images of the <span
class=SpellE>jewellery</span>, ensuring the media associated with the NFT can
never be taken offline.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

